  "description": "Swansea University has 8 colleges spread across its two campuses which are located on the coastline of Swansea Bay, a very beautiful part of Wales. The Hillary Rodham Clinton School of Law is the largest Law School in Wales and ranks third in the UK for Criminology and twenty-second in the UK for Law (The Times Good University Guide 2019). Swansea University Medical School is ranked as the third best medical school in the UK according to the Complete University Guide 2017. It also ranked joint first in the UK for Research Environment, according to the Research Excellence Framework 2014. International Students can study Undergraduate and Postgraduate pathways with at the International College which lead onto a degree at Swansea University. Timestamps",
